  },
  "1069405866": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1874665458,
   "actor": "V_Leilani",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Oh, don’t get me wrong—it’s cute that you tried. Really. But honestly, did you actually think you had a shot at first place?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "645784018": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1874665458,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I wasn’t here to win. It was just for fun.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2084245159": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1874665458,
   "actor": "V_Leilani",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Fun, huh? Well, good for you. Second place is still... respectable, I guess. I mean, considering the competition.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1371983745": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1874665458,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": " Enjoy your win, Leilani. It won't last forever.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "976654386": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1874665458,
   "actor": "V_Leilani",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Oh, I plan to. But don’t worry—I’m sure second place feels like a win to someone like you.",
   "settings": {
